      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Press Show on A on the left Output and Show on B on the right one. In the Main Mixer panel the A / B balance runs from all A at \u22121 to all B at +1; set Crossfade to a wipe or a luminance fade and sweep it. The deck that is off air keeps playing, so change its patch while the other one is on \u2014 that is what two decks are for."
        }
